  description: A barrier device designed for safer sex and contraception. It is made
    from a thin, stretchy material of natural rubber latex that unrolls over an erect
    penis with a reservoir tip to collect fluids. It prevents the exchange of bodily
    fluids during sex and reduces the risk of sexually transmitted infections and
    unintended pregnancy.
